{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":15,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"923aa2fc-6f4e-407a-8918-31445ab96377","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390686446,"PostDateInt":1721014390000,"PostDate":"2024-07-15T11:33:10","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"SSC专员","OrgId":897728,"Org":"人力资源中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"8K-10K 元/月","Duty":"1、建立和完善SSC相关管理制度、标准规范及工作流程，对SSC各项规范及流程进行盘点及优化；\n2、负责员工入转调离各类流程手续办理；负责管理员工信息资料及各类人事资料、档案，维护员工信息；\n3、负责员工考勤管理，包含假期统计、月度考勤报表、考勤系统优化及制度修订等；\n4、负责公司级相关合同（劳动合同、劳务协议等）签署、续签及档案管理等相关事宜；\n5、负责公司人才房的管理，包含人才房的申请、分配、轮候、退出等；\n6、搭建流畅的沟通机制，快速解决员工的困惑及诉求，提升员工的满意度及归属感。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，1年以上人力资源SSC模块相关经验，有海外留学经历或英文可作为工作语言优先；\n2、英语专业或同等英语资格，具有较强的英语听说读写能力，具有跨文化沟通能力，推进海外SSC工作的持续优化和和合规用工，可接受优秀应届生；\n3、熟悉SSC模块各项实务的操作流程；熟悉国家相关法律法规；\n4、较强的执行能力和应变能力，能及时接收领导的有关指示并快速进行回应及执行；有较强的适应能力，能快速融入团队并展开工作；\n5、自驱力强，工作认真细致，性格开朗、热爱各类运动，我们期待热心好学的你，一起打怪升级。","ClassificationOne":"职能","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-07-15T11:33:10","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"Repea